notes.content:
Looks like that all bugs fixed, and all wishes taken into account, so I finally can set the discount :)

[h1]Thanks to:[/h1]
[list]
    [*][b]マレクーカレヌ[/b] five times for a bugs reports;
    [*][b]К.Воробьянинов[/b] for a bug report;
    [*][b]AFAK[/b] for a bug report;
    [*][b]Waxarall[/b] for a bug report;
    [*][b]фонд спидвагона[/b] for a typo report;
    [*][b]Grey83[/b] for a typo report.
[/list]
And to others who believed in the game (someone already changed nickname, but it is their fault :D).

Have a good game :)

KAT_Editor

[h1]Full list of changes:[/h1]

[olist]
    [*]Fixed main level 16, which can be solved with less moves then available;
    [*]Fixed backlight of maing game mode button, which shown before player finished tutorial;
    [*]Changed speed of moving objects at bonus level 9;
    [*]Fixed level passing sound, at which you hear choir;
    [*]Fixed shadows at bonus level 20, which dissapearing at fat objects;
    [*]Fixed not working Space/Enter/Esc buttons in some interfaces;
    [*]Added sounds after pressing interface butons with keyboards keys (R, Space, Enter, Esc);
    [*]Changed the distracting line "2+2=4" to "2+2*2=6" in the tip for the location of the Easter Egg.
 [/olist]

[h1]Also:[/h1]
[olist]
    [*]Added video with levels solutions to Steam guide - https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2679675431;
    [*]Created the game Discord server - https://discord.gg/kUHfj92k .
 [/olist]

Setting a planned update date is prevents me from concentrating, so I won't post it again :)

Have a good game :)

KAT_Editor

[h1]Full list of changes:[/h1]

[olist]
    [*]Сhanged main levels 9, 12, 15, 21, 22;
    [*]Removed mouse move click tips on emptry spaces at levels without inversion;
    [*]Fixed strange white areas on levels backgrounds;
    [*]Now after move with a small chance at main and bonus levels you can meet mini KAT_Editor (without any reasons);
    [*]Fixed line spacing of game name on the Steam library image.
[/olist]

This patch was planned to January 31, 2022, but released at February 1, 2022,even a machine cannot indicate the exact time of waiting.

Have a good game :)

KAT_Editor

[h1]Full list of changes:[/h1]

[olist]
    [*]Changed all images with logo and red/green objects, because with old material and lighting they looks flat;
    [*]Now backgrounds change theur color(-s) more noticable. Looks like that before this noone dont noticed that backgrounds change color(-s);
    [*]Now tiles fragments slowly fly up and down;
    [*]Replaced experemental outlevel click tips with something not experemental. Now random and created levels also have this tip;
    [*]Fixed typo in the easter egg achievement (thanks to マレクーカレヌ for report).
[/olist]

This patch was released at January 24, 2022, as planned.

Have a good game :)

KAT_Editor

[h1]Full list of changes:[/h1]

[olist]
       [*] Changed location of the easter egg. Looks like that before that all players, who received the corresponding achievement, found easter egg accidentally;
[*] Changed main levels 2, 8, 11, 13, 16 (slightly changed) and 23;
[*] Fixed "Random generation" inversion arrow tip, which stay after other levels with inversion (thanks for report to К.Воробьянинов);
       [*] Fixed displaying of mouse move tip;
[*] Changed tutorial images with mouse controls;
[*] Maximum (medium) settings get optinized, so now owners of old graphics cards will receive for about 25% more FPS without graphics changes;
[*] Changed "Workshop" button to "Create / Load", to not get confused like its Steam Workshop;
[*] Changed "Hotkeys" button image;
[*] Model of available clicks next to tiles at levels with inverted controls rotated for a bit, but still experemental;
[*] Total version (195) no longer displayed in the main menu, because before Steam release I count version every working day, but now bigger patches coming every week.
[/olist]

This patch was released at January 17, 2022, as planned.

Have a good game :)

KAT_Editor

[h1]Full list of changes:[/h1]

[olist]
[*] The game version is updated from 1.0.0.6 to 1.0.1.0, and now version displayed in the main menu. Now big patches changing version for +0.0.1.0, and small for +0.0.0.1;
[*] Added drawing feature! You can draw everywhere by holding right mosue button, scrolling mouse wheel will erase last line, middle mouse button will erase all lines;
[*] Added hotkeys (enter/space, R, Esc), more infromation you can found after pressing new button in the main menu (birning enter);
[*] Changed the start of synchronization of Steam achievements, in the achievements menu, to pressing the new button (magnifier);
[*] Now on inverted levels mouse will show in which direction player will move, also tutorial and main levels with inversion now have experemental objecs outside tiles, which show that you also can click here;
[*] Change inscription Unreal Engine to Unreal Engine 4 in the about menu;
[*] Fixed 60+ FPS modes which without VSync breaks levels with movable objects (thanks to マレクーカレヌ for report);
[*] Fixed inversion controls for "Keyboard Rage" mode (thanks to マレクーカレヌ for report);
[*] Fixed random levels music, which always have same volume (thanks to マレクーカレヌ for report);
[*] Fixed camera position on levels with inversion;
[*] Changed "Memorization" mouse hovering model;
[*] Path to easter egg achievement tip changed for a little;
[*] Fixed achievements info, and add more information about easter egg.
[/olist]

This patch was planned to January 10, 2022, but released at January 11, 2022, because adding hotkeys took more time then I expected.

Have a good game :)

KAT_Editor
